            <title>2.1.17b1</title>
            <description>&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Click row in timeline sets the diagram to that date.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Fixed broked &quot;Add birth&quot; and &quot;Edit birth&quot; buttons in person properties&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Fixed person picker in add form not showing renamed people in auto-complete.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Can now use down/up arrows + enter/return to pick a person via autocomplete in add event form.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Visual timeline shows person names now.&lt;/li&gt;
